# Recorded input for the radio group page (widgets/radio.zig, `Page`), at 320 x 120 in the
# default theme: Low, Medium (selected) and High, rings at x 12..28, options at y 12..30,
# 36..53 and 59..77. One line per frame below (format: input.Replay). Scancodes: Right 79,
# Left 80, Down 81, Up 82, Space 44.
# 0: rest: Medium selected
frame
viewport 320 120
dt 0.016
pointer 300 110
# 1: press High (it takes focus)
frame
pointer 20 68
buttons left
# 2: release: High selected
frame
buttons
# 3: Down wraps to Low, focus follows
frame
pointer 300 110
press 81
# 4: Right: Medium
frame
press 79
# 5: Up then Left in one frame: Medium -> Low -> High (wraps)
frame
press 82
press 80
# 6: a press on the panel takes focus away
frame
buttons left
# 7: Down does nothing now
frame
buttons
press 81
